# Optional: hard-code real Outlook folder IDs to skip the auto-resolve step.
# Find these by running the script once — it will log the IDs it discovers.
# Paste them here and future runs will be faster and more reliable.
# FREDFEUER_FOLDER_ID=
# WASCH_FOLDER_ID=
# ─── Download paths ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LOCAL_DOWNLOAD_PATH   → where YOU see files on the host (or on Desktop for prod)
# N8N_CONTAINER_DOWNLOAD_PATH → same folder as seen from inside the n8n container
#
# For development/testing (project downloads/ folder):
LOCAL_DOWNLOAD_PATH=./downloads/
N8N_CONTAINER_DOWNLOAD_PATH=/home/node/downloads/

# For production (client's Desktop — update this in the real .env, not here):
# LOCAL_DOWNLOAD_PATH=C:/Users/YourName/Desktop/TaxAutomation/
# N8N_CONTAINER_DOWNLOAD_PATH=/host_desktop/TaxAutomation/